{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41504","headline":"蟠溪怀古 · 孟宾于","name":"蟠溪怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"良哉吕尚父，深隐始归周。\n钓石千年在，春风一水流。\n松根盘藓石，花影卧沙鸥。\n谁更怀韬术，追思古渡头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟宾于","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41504.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41504","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}